 dia\nFuma Fuma- Paris\nNyla Couture- Los Angeles\nCatherine Brickhill- Lon
 don\nVictoria Trent- United States\nKimily Jiang- California\nLotti Dolli-
  Paris\nEmilia Batarase- California\nThe Event Program is Follows:\n6pm- R
 ed Carpet Social Hour\n7.30pm- One of a kind Fashion Show\n10pm- Fashion W
