DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer“Lindy in the Park” Swing 
 Dance Party (Golden Gate Park)Get ready to swing in Golden Gate Park every
  sunny Sunday at “Lindy in the Park\,” a weekly free event near the de
  Young Museum\, when the streets of Golden Gate Park are closed to traffic
  and the dancers take over.\nThis in person event resumed June 20\, 2021\n
 \nLindy in the Park | Free Outdoor Swing Dance & Lessons\nEvery Sunday | 1
 1 am to 2 pm\nJFK Dr. btwn 8th and 10th\, behind the De Young Museum\, Gol
 den Gate Park\, SF\nFREE\nRain and Bay to Breakers cancels\, but other tha
 n that\, Lindy in the Park takes place every Sunday – even on holidays 
 – so even if New Year’s Day\, Christmas\, or Fourth of July falls on a
  Sunday\, they’ll be out there dancing. On the very rare occasion when t
 hey cancel\, they’ll make a new posting on their website\, usually by 10
 am on Sunday. Lindy in the Park’s Schedule FAQ\nFree Beginners Swing Les
 sons | Noon to 12:30 pm\nLindy in the Park offers a free weekly beginning 
 swing dance lesson\, taught by Hep Jen. The lessons are short\, easy and f
 un and then you can practice your new steps with the whole group until 2 p
 m.\nNo partner is required\, as they rotate leaders and followers througho
 ut the lesson.\nUpdated 7/8/2021 – Event info last checked via website.\
 n\nUpcoming “Lindy in the Park” Swing Dance Party (Golden Gate Park) E
 vents\nSun 10/11 “Lindy in the Park” Swing Dance Party (Golden Gate Pa
 rk)Sun 10/18 “Lindy in the Park” Swing Dance Party (Golden Gate Park)S
 un 10/25 “Lindy in the...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: http://www.lindyinthepark.
 com/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/lindy-in-the-park-swing-dance-party
 -golden-gate-park-273/\nSource: Funcheap SF
