DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerA new\, 1 hour Sunday-afternoo
 n performance series to be offered free and designed to cultivate ODC’s 
 next generation of arts patrons while providing accessible and joyful entr
 y points into dance for families through direct access to artists and the 
 creative process. Programming blends performance\, participation\, and “
 behind-the-scenes” insight.\nIntroduce your family to the joy of live pe
 rformance with this free Sunday afternoon performance series! Designed to 
 cultivate the next generation of arts patrons with accessible and joyful e
 ntry points into dance\, Family Matters blends performance\, participation
 \, and behind-the-scenes insights with chances to meet artists and join th
 e creative process.\n\nSunday-Afternoon Performance Series Schedule:\n\nSu
 nday\, October 4\, 2026 @ 1:00pm – ODC Theater Home Company\, Kinetech A
 rts.\nSunday\, November 1\, 2026 @ 1:00pm – ODC/Dance will share excerpt
 s of The Velveteen Rabbit.\nSunday\, December 13\, 2026 @ 1:00pm – ODC/S
 chool teen hip hop company\, SEEDS.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://odc.dance/
 familymatters\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/family-matters-gen-series/
 \nSource: Funcheap SF
