BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The First Sunset Mid-Autumn Dance Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17861969@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Dance
DESCRIPTION:The First Sunset Mid-Autumn Dance Festival\n\nJoin San Francis
 co Youth Ballet and Sunset Choreographers for the inaugural Sunset Mid-Aut
 umn Dance Festival\, a one-time performance celebrating the emerging dance
  community of San Francisco's west side.\n\nThis 70-minute\, family-friend
 ly program brings together emerging Sunset-based choreographers\, professi
 onal Bay Area dance artists\, and talented young dancers from San Francisc
 o Youth Ballet Academy for an afternoon of classical and contemporary danc
 e.\n\nThe program features original works by Ria Fifield\, Tai Lum\, Eli S
 hi\, and Sophia West\, exploring themes including family\, ritual\, devoti
 on\, cultural tradition\, change\, and the stories passed between generati
 ons.\n\nPresented by San Francisco Youth Ballet and Sunset Choreographers.
 \n\nDate: Sunday\, October 4\, 2026\nTime: 2:00 PM\nLocation: CAIS Theater
 \, 3250 19th Ave\, San Francisco\, CA 94132\nLength: Approximately 70 minu
 tes\nAudience: Family-friendly\n\nTickets and additional information are a
 vailable through the San Francisco Youth Ballet website.\n\n$22-27.\n\nPre
 sented by San Francisco Youth Ballet Theatre\n\n$22-27.\nSan Francisco You
 th Ballet Theatre\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/4/the-fi
 rst-sunset-mid-autumn-dance-festival-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
