SUMMARY:Underground Labs: Kronos
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639645@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerKronos\nGo behind the scenes w
 ith the Kronos Quartet as they rehearse new works and share a look at thei
 r creative process. In the process\, Kronos has become one of the most cel
 ebrated and influential groups of our era\, performing thousands of concer
 ts worldwide\, releasing more than 70 recordings of extraordinary breadth 
 and creativity\, and collaborating with many of the world’s most accompl
 ished composers and performers. Through its nonprofit organization\, Krono
 s Performing Arts Association (KPAA)\, Kronos has commissioned more than 1
 \,100 works and arrangements for string quartet—including the recently c
 ompleted 50 for the Future library of free\, educational repertoire. Krono
 s has received more than 40 awards\, including three Grammy Awards and the
  Polar Music\, Avery Fisher\, and Edison Klassiek Oeuvre Prizes—among th
 e most prestigious awards given to musicians. In 2024\, the Library of Con
 gress announced its acquisition of the Archive of Kronos Quartet/Kronos Pe
 rforming Arts Association\, a collection that includes 50 years’ worth o
 f manuscripts\, instruments\, costumes\, video and audio recordings\, phot
 ographs\, and more.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://lcalive.org/public/events/
 496c1896-1a0a-4d86-bbd4-eb41acb25225\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/und
 erground-labs-kronos/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screen
 shot-2026-09-28-at-1.14.23-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Studio 1\, San Francisco State University\, 1756 Holloway Ave\, S
 an Francisco\, CA 94132
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/underground-labs-kronos/
END:VEVENT
