BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Other Minds Festival 30
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1626431@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe Other Minds Festival turns
  30! On Thursday–Sunday\, October 8–11\, 2026\, our annual showcase fo
 r composers will be held at the Brava Theater in San Francisco’s Mission
  District.\nThe Festival opens with Joseph Bohigian’s I Am He Whose Life
  and Soul Are Torment\, an evening-length multimedia work about the life o
 f the visionary Soviet-Armenian film director Sergei Parajanov (1924–199
 0) that combines the multilingual songs of the 18th century bard Sayat Nov
 a in Armenian\, Azeri\, and Georgian with live electronic manipulation of 
 recordings by South Caucasus folk musicians. A collaboration with vocalist
  and duduk player Khatchadour Khatchadourian\, Ensemble Decipher\, and art
 ists Tara Baghdassarian and Karo Yagjian\, the piece is written for solo v
 oice\, duduk\, electronics ensemble\, and video projection.\n\nOn Night 2\
 , the Swiss-born\, New York-based Sylvie Courvoisier combines European cha
 mber music and American avant-jazz in a performance for solo piano. Mahsa 
 Vahdat performs original song settings of Persian poetry\, accompanied by 
 setar player Atabak Elyasi. Vahdat’s compositions are inspired by her li
 fe in exile\, her deep belonging to her homeland of Iran\, and her dedicat
 ion to preserving and reviving Iranian music. Night 2 ends with Juri Seo
 ’s Just Intonation Etudes and Wildflowers followed by the world premiere
  of her Bad Decision for string quartet\, bass\, and drumset\, with Fricti
 on Quartet.\nNight 3 opens with Kristin Norderval and Elizabeth Gaver\, w.
 ..\n\n$23.00\n\nTickets: https://www.otherminds.org/other-minds-festival-3
 0/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/minds-festival-30/\nSource: Funcheap 
 SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/OtherM
 inds0226_1600.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Brava Theater\, 2781 24th St\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/minds-festival-30/
END:VEVENT
