CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerWe PlayersMeet CASEMA: The Con
 ference Attending Society of Eleusinian Mystery Appreciators! A self-style
 d secret society\, these massive fans of classical antiquity pose as hotel
  service workers in order to sneak into academic conferences and in this w
 ay be close to their erudite heroes and absorb some essence of their Olymp
 ic-level intellectual prowess. Our characters make the ancient myths their
  own through unique interpretations and stitch themselves into the lineage
  of homeric bards through telling their versions of the tales. Bringing th
 emselves joy by taking it all very seriously and savoring silliness\, thes
 e clowns know that like the Gods themselves we can be both sacred and ridi
 culous\, solemn and irreverent\, agnostic and devoted\, petty and sincere\
 , all at once. Perhaps this is the truth the Gods represent\, that the Div
 ine is all things\, in all places\, at all times\, all at once.\n\n$25.00\
 n\nTickets: https://www.weplayers.org/odyssea-cfb-2026\nDetails: https://s
 f.funcheap.com/odyssea/\nSource: Funcheap SF
