 ts' bodies\, it's ultimately up to the few who are left\, an unlikely coll
 ection of loners\, leaders\, nerds\, and jocks\, to save the world from al
 ien domination.\n\nPresented on 35mm by Odyssey Film Institute. Dedicated 
