DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerKULARTS / Johan CasalTubong to
  Living Ancestors explores the intersection of indigenous ritual and conte
 mporary performance homage to diasporic Pilipino and Asian legacy artists 
 and culture bearers. We honor [17] Pilipino and Asian American legacy arti
 sts and culture bearers with new works and restaged works from 1980’s & 
 1990’s. The Alleluia Panis Dance Theatre will perform to the music of Jo
 hn Calloway (music director) on percussion and flute\, Francis Wong on sax
 \, Chris Trinidad on bass\, and on kulintang ensemble Conrad Benedicto and
  Jinji Saysa.\n*Tubong is traditional celebration ritual\, typically perfo
 rmed to honor elders and connect with ancestors.\n\n$30.00\n\nTickets: htt
 ps://www.kularts-sf.org/upcoming-events/tubong-to-living-ancestors\nDetail
