BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SF’s “Circus By The Bay” Night: History Panel + Wild Live Ac
 ts (Fort Mason)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T203000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1637221@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Fort Mason Center for Arts & CultureCowell Theater hosts a pan
 el conversation and live performances exploring San Francisco’s new Amer
 ican circus movement. Pickle Family Circus and New Pickle Circus veterans 
 Gypsy Snider\, Shana Carroll\, Jeff Raz\, and Tandy Beal will discuss the 
 scene’s history\, alongside archival photos and video and performances b
 y artists from Prescott Circus\, Dear San Francisco\, Circus Bella\, and S
 an Francisco Youth Circus.\nOriginal Event Description:\nCIRCUS BY THE BAY
 \nPanel conversation and live performances\nTuesday\, October 13\, 2026 
 – 7:00 p.m. to 8:30 p.m.\nCowell Theater\, Pier 2/Gateway Pavilion\, FMC
 AC\, RESERVE SPACE\nIn the 1970s\, San Francisco became an epicenter of th
 e emerging new American circus – an intimate one-ring model that spurned
  animal acts and focused on traditional skills of juggling\, clowning\, ac
 robatics\, and aerial work\, all filtered through a countercultural vaudev
 illian sensibility. This “not-so-big-top” was pioneered by such local 
 companies as the Pickle Family Circus and its later incarnation\, the New 
 Pickle Circus\, which performed annually at Fort Mason Center For Arts & C
 ulture\, and longtime FMCAC residents Make*A*Circus. This movement spawned
  a stream of Bay Area talents that spread their influence from Cirque du S
 oleil and Broadway to movies\, and TV\, an impact which resonates to this 
 day.\nJoin us for a magical evening celebrating this uniquely San Francisc
 o history through a conversation with some of its leading lights\, all vet
 er...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/circus-by-the-bay-t
 ickets-1999623076450\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-circus-bay-nigh
 t-history-panel-wild-live-acts-fort-mason/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/FM_Art
 _PoD_Fall_2026_pickle_circus-1_951x506.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Cowell Theater\, Pier 2/Gateway Pavilion\, FMCAC\, 2 Marina Blvd\
 , San Francisco\, CA 94123
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-circus-bay-night-history-panel-wild-live-a
 cts-fort-mason/
END:VEVENT
