 ns with a diabolical plan beyond their worst nightmares! A dazzling mixtur
 e of nerve-shredding suspense\, eye-popping science fiction and full-blood
 ed horror from the maestro of the macabre\, Mario Bava (Black Sunday\, Bla
 ck Sabbath)\, Planet of the Vampires inspired decades of space-age shocker
 s and now proudly stands as one of the most electrifying\, visually stunni
