 nging together San Francisco’s dance\, music\, food and creative communi
 ties for a full day of fun outside the shop.\n\nThe event is free and open
  to the public. Come celebrate two years of Whack Donuts in the neighborho
 od\, catch some breakin’\, support local artists and businesses\, and gr
 ab some baked-not-fried vegan donuts along the way.\n\nThis will be Whack 
 Donuts’ last big outdoor celebration at the plaza before the upcoming re
 novation\, so come make it count.\n\nWhack Donuts! 2-Year Anniversary JamO
 ctober 24\, 2026\nSchedule\n\n11 am–1 pm: Setup\n1:30 pm: Prelims\n2 pm:
