 eaningful impact. This year’s event is designed as an immersive dinner a
 nd show experience with live music\, dining\, dancing\, and storytelling m
 oments that connect guests directly to Conard House’s mission and the pe
 ople at the center of it.\nWhen you purchase a ticket\, you are doing two 
 things at once. You are joining a unique San Francisco event\, and you are
  helping fund Conard House programs that support adults in building resili
 ence and stability. Your presence also expands awareness by bringing new p
 eople into the Conard House community and increasing visibility for the wo
 rk happening every day across our programs.\n\nJoin us for an evening wher
 e your presence creates momentum for the mission and the people it serves.
