BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Oceánica Ballet 2026 (San Mateo)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T180000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1640600@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Dance
DESCRIPTION:Vin EiamvuthikornJoin Oceánica Ballet for family-friendly sto
 ry ballets inspired by halloween and Día de los Muertos!\nViva La Vida wi
 th Excerpts from P1N0CCH10 & Carmilla features new works and a returning O
 ceánica Ballet autumn tradition. Act 1 premieres selections from two upco
 ming story ballets. P1N0CCH10\, a retelling of Carlo Collodi’s classic t
 ale\, explores humanity\, artificial intelligence\, and our relationship w
 ith the natural world. Carmilla\, an adaptation of Sheridan Le Fanu’s gr
 oundbreaking sapphic vampire novella\, stages a mysterious masquerade ball
 .\nAct Two features the return of Viva La Vida\, the original story of Luc
 io and Lupita in a joyful folklórico-infused tale about transcending loss
  and the resilience of love\, inspired by Día de los Muertos. In this “
 celebration of life\, loved ones and culture\,” writes Jocelyn Tong of t
 he Daily Californian\, “mythic creatures from the land of the dead … [
 lead to] twirled scarves and snapped-open fans …in a story of homecoming
 .” Throughout all three stories\, the wisdom of women across time and cu
 ltures is amplified.\nViva La Vida with Excerpts from P1N0CCH10 & Carmilla
 \nSunday\, November 1\, 2026 | 1p & 4p\nCollege of San Mateo Theatre\, 170
 0 W Hillsdale Blvd\, San Mateo – Map & Directions\nGet Tickets: Start at
  $29 – General Admission (fees included)\n\nLimited time offer Lucky 13:
  13% off 4:00 performance on Sunday\, November 1st tix when purchased Oct 
 2 thru Oct 13 2026 while supplies last. Lowest price tickets are $25.25 in
 cluding...\n\n$29.00\n\nTickets: https://oceanicaballet.org/\nDetails: htt
 ps://sf.funcheap.com/ocenica-ballet-2026-san-mateo/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/VLV202
 6LinkTreeAliceOnly.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:College of San Mateo Theatre\, 1700 W Hillsdale Blvd (Bldg 3)\, S
 an Mateo
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/ocenica-ballet-2026-san-mateo/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Behind-the-Scenes Talk: How SF Neo-Futurists Run 100 Shows a 
 Year (SF Main Library)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261104T193000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639766@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:SF Neo-FuturistsLearn what it takes to write\, direct and perf
 orm 100 SHOWS A YEAR as a small group of artists who also RUN THE BUSINESS
  together. It’s not a sitcom\, it’s The San Francisco Neo-Futurists. T
 hey put on the Infinite Wrench\, the show the SF Chronicle calls one of 
 “22 San Francisco things everyone must do!”\nThey’ll pull back the c
 urtain on how they operate as a non-hierarchical consensus-based collectiv
 e to organize performance space\, run committees\, budget and raise funds 
 and ultimately put on a show every week. They’ll also cover their proces
 s for writing new material for a new cast of performers to put on a differ
 ent show every Friday and Saturday night.\nThe SF Neos are a collective of
  wildly prolific artists dedicated to the perpetual creation of experiment
 al theatre that is immediate\, ephemeral\, accessible and cheap. They beli
 eve the stage is an extension of daily life: they perform as themselves in
  a non-illusory\, interactive style that challenges the audience to create
  alongside them as active participants with a voice of their own. They res
 pect and uplift each other on and off stage through non-hierarchical accou
 ntability\, collective decision-making and anti-oppression practice of all
  kinds.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfpl.org/events/2026/11/04/presentatio
 n-collectively-operating-performance-theater-sf\nDetails: https://sf.funch
 eap.com/free-behindthescenes-talk-sf-neofuturists-run-100-shows-year-sf-ma
 in-library/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Neo-Fu
 turists-Booked.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:SFPL Main Library Steve Silver Room (4th Floor)\, 100 Larkin Stre
 et\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-behindthescenes-talk-sf-neofuturists-run-
 100-shows-year-sf-main-library/
END:VEVENT
